    "dpkg 的 statoverride 仍引用已删除的系统用户或组。先备份并检查 /var/lib/dpkg/statoverride；确认相关服务已卸载后，用 sudo dpkg-statoverride --remove <路径> 逐条移除，再运行 sudo dpkg --configure -a 和 sudo apt-get -f install。OpsDeck 不会自动删除这些系统记录。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "dpkg's statoverride still references a deleted system user or group. Back up and inspect /var/lib/dpkg/statoverride first. After confirming the related service has been removed, delete each stale entry with sudo dpkg-statoverride --remove <path>, then run sudo dpkg --configure -a and sudo apt-get -f install. OpsDeck will not delete these system records automatically."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
