    "sudo 授权失败：这台服务器的 sudo 需要密码。OpsDeck 已尝试用你的 SSH 登录密码，但未通过——通常是登录密码与 sudo 密码不同，或该账号没有 sudo 权限。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "sudo authorization failed: this server's sudo requires a password. OpsDeck tried your SSH login password, but it was rejected — usually the login password differs from the sudo password, or the account lacks sudo rights."
          }
