    "新建站点模板：保存将写入 sites-available（需要时自动用 sudo）；启用需软链到 sites-enabled 后 reload。保存时会跑 nginx -t 校验，不通过会自动回滚。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "New site template. Saving writes to sites-available (using sudo when needed); enable it by symlinking into sites-enabled, then reload. Saving runs nginx -t and rolls back automatically if it fails."
          }
        },
