    "装东西慢或失败，多半是源离服务器太远。国内服务器换国内镜像提速（本机在阿里云选阿里云最快，同内网）；海外服务器则选「官方源」直连上游，国内镜像反而会更慢。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Slow or failed installs usually mean the source is too far from the server. For servers in China, switch to a domestic mirror (this machine is on Alibaba Cloud, so Alibaba Cloud is fastest — same internal network); for overseas servers, choose “Official” to connect upstream directly — domestic mirrors would be slower."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
